     ]
  ] ;
  fhir:ImplementationGuide.description [ fhir:value "The USQualityCore Implementation Guide defines a set of FHIR profiles with extensions and bindings needed to create interoperable, quality-focused applications. The profiles in this implementation guide derive from and extend the [US Core](http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core) profiles to provide a common foundation for building, sharing, and evaluating knowledge artifacts across quality improvement efforts in the US Realm."] ;
